# Contact form delivery.
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter your email address — no account needed.
# 2. They email you an access key. Paste it below.
# 3. Locally:  copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the key.
# 4. On Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables → add
#    VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY, then redeploy.
#
# If this is left unset, the contact form falls back to opening the
# visitor's mail client instead of silently dropping the message.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
